&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Proton and build a better internet where privacy is the default&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Proton, we believe that privacy is a fundamental human right and the cornerstone of democracy. Since our inception in 2014, founded by a team of scientists from CERN, we have dedicated ourselves to providing free and open-source technology to millions worldwide, ensuring access to privacy, security, and freedom online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our journey began with Proton Mail, the largest secure email service globally, and has since expanded to include Proton VPN, Proton Calendar, Proton Drive, and Proton Pass. These tools empower individuals and organizations to take control of their personal data, break away from Big Tech’s invasive practices, and defeat censorship. Our work impacts hundreds of millions of lives, from activists on the front lines defending freedom to leaders in governments protecting sensitive information. In some cases, Proton’s services have even been instrumental in saving lives by enabling secure and private communications in high-risk situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proton today supports over 100 million user accounts with a growing team of over 500 people from over 50 different countries, from the world&#39;s top companies and universities. We value intelligence, learning potential, and ambition in our hiring process. Adaptability is key as we navigate uncharted territories and redefine how business is conducted online. We believe smaller teams of exceptional talent will always prevail over larger teams with lower talent density. Proton has become profitable and reached scale without relying upon VC funding, largely due to superior talent that allows us to do things faster, more creatively, and more efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global mindset and big ambitions but remain a start-up at heart. We value empowerment and flexibility and keep our structure flat to keep moving fast and avoid unnecessary politics. Tired of blending into the crowd? Join us and do work you can truly be proud of.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXP96911575 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXP96911575 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;df41d9b1-a4e5-469e-b94c-9c31cb38a786&quot;&gt;Check our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;social media pages&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more about us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://x.com/ProtonPrivacy&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.reddit.com/r/ProtonMail/&quot;&gt;Reddit&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/protonprivacy/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Business Development Manager focused on building strategic partnerships and generating high-quality pipeline for Proton’s B2B business. This is a key role focused on identifying and unlocking new business opportunities — not closing deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;You will work on developing relationships with key organisations, partners, and networks — particularly within Switzerland — to position Proton within strategic ecosystems and create long-term pipeline opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;This role requires a strong talent to network, a “hunter” mindset for opportunity creation, and the ability to navigate complex organisations to open doors for commercial engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Pipeline Creation &amp;amp; Strategic Opportunity Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Identify and develop new strategic opportunities across target segments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Build a pipeline of high-quality opportunities for the sales team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Focus on long-term opportunity creation rather than short-term deal closing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Strategic Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Identify, engage, and develop partnerships with corporates, industry bodies, service providers, ecosystem partners (including co-selling opportunities)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Market Development (Switzerland Focus)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Leverage your existing network within Swiss corporates and organisations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Expand Proton’s presence within local business ecosystems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Identify high-value entry points into target companies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Relationship Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Build strong relationships with senior stakeholders (IT, security, leadership)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Act as a trusted advisor and entry point into organisations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Navigate complex organisational structures to identify opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Sales Opportunity Discovery and Closing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Identify and qualify opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Provide clear context on use case, stakeholders, potential deal scope&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;-Negotiate and close deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Work closely with Sales leadership to align on target segments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Provide feedback on market opportunities and ICP evolution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Share insights from partnerships and market interactions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- 3–7 years in Business Development, Partnerships, or Strategic Sales roles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Experience in B2B SaaS or technology environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Proven track record in building partnerships and generating pipeline&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;Network&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Strong existing network within Swiss companies and/or business ecosystem (highly preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Appetite to develop and grow a network of Swiss and DACH companies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Strong relationship-building and networking capabilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Ability to identify and develop strategic opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Strong communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Comfortable operating without a structured playbook&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;Languages&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Fluent in English (required)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Business-level proficiency in BOTH French and German (required)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;Mindset&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Hunter mindset focused on opportunity creation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Strategic thinker with strong commercial instincts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Proactive, self-driven, and comfortable operating in ambiguity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Long-term relationship builder&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;- Proton is an office-first company. We expect you to spend most of your time in the office, and while we do offer some flexibility to work from home, we believe in-person collaboration helps us build the best products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We provide all the devices and software you need to excel in your role, ensuring you have the best tools at your disposal to achieve your goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lunch and snacks are provided by Proton every day at our offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We will always support our employees with transport costs through subsidizing public transport, bike allowances, or parking spaces based on your office location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;At Proton, we are all owners of the company and you get stock options when you join us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You can define your own working hours as long as it works with team meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are committed to your professional growth. Proton offers various learning opportunities, including training programs, conferences and events, and continual learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comprehensive health insurance plans, competitive retirement savings options, generous vacation and leave policies, and wellness programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proton is a community-first organization, started with the support of a crowdfunding campaign and built with community input. To this day, Proton’s only source of revenue is user subscriptions. Over 100 million people trust and support Proton, and we put our users and community first in everything we do. Read more about our impact&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://proton.me/impact&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check our social media to learn more about Proton:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/protonprivacy/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.reddit.com/r/ProtonMail/&quot;&gt;Reddit&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://x.com/intent/user?screen_name=ProtonPrivacy&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@ProtonAG&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background, feel valued and empowered. We strive to create equal opportunities, promote open dialogue, and support continuous learning to ensure every voice is heard and respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you apply for a position, refer a candidate, or are considered for a role at Proton Technologies AG (Proton, we, us, or our), your information is stored in Greenhouse, in accordance with their&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Service Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;This information is used to evaluate your suitability for the posted position. We also retain this information for consideration for future roles that you may apply for or that we believe may align with your background and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If we no longer have a legitimate business need to process your information, we will either delete or anonymize it. Should you have any inquiries about how we use or manage your information, or if you wish to access, correct, or delete your data, please contact our privacy team at careers@proton.ch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proton does not accept unsolicited resumes from any sources other than directly from candidates. We will not pay a fee for any placement resulting from an unsolicited offer, even if the candidate is subsequently hired by Proton.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To learn more about our privacy policy, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://boards.eu.greenhouse.io/protongdpr&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;our privacy policy page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LinkedIn-Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Join Proton and build a better internet where privacy is the default&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;Proton was founded in 2014 by scientists from CERN on a simple truth:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;privacy is a fundamental human right&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. Since then, we’ve built the world’s largest encrypted email service (Proton Mail) and expanded into Proton VPN, Proton Drive, Proton Pass, and Proton Calendar—tools used by millions globally to protect their freedom, fight censorship, and keep their data safe. In some situations, Proton has literally helped save lives!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;We are profitable, independent (no VC control), and selectively hire from the top ~1% of applicants. Our 700+ team members across 50+ countries come from leading organizations and elite academic backgrounds. We move fast, keep hierarchy light, and prioritize impact over optics. If you want to do meaningful work with exceptionally high-caliber people, this is it. Join us and do work you can truly be proud of. Check our open-source projects&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;Lexical__link&quot; href=&quot;https://proton.me/community/open-source&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Purpose of the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;Proton is growing fast as more people worldwide seek greater control over their online privacy. To support that growth, we&#39;re hiring a Senior Engineering Manager to lead a team on one of our upcoming products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll join the engineering leadership team, helping turn technical strategy into execution and contributing to a more privacy centric internet. We&#39;re looking for an Engineering Manager with a strong mobile focus. That means a track record of building and scaling customer facing mobile applications, in B2C or B2B, for millions of users on iOS and/or Android.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;Beyond technical depth, our Engineering Managers bring strong people management skills, clear communication, a business mindset, and genuine empathy for customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience leading and growing engineering teams of 10+ engineers in a fast-paced product environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Proven success managing&amp;nbsp;fully remote and/or distributed engineering teams, with strong operational and communication practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to partner closely with&amp;nbsp;Product and Design&amp;nbsp;on strategy, roadmap planning, prioritization, and execution. Comfortable challenging assumptions, driving alignment, and translating ambiguity into high-quality product delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Strong technical foundation in&amp;nbsp;mobile engineering, with deep expertise in&amp;nbsp;Swift, Kotlin, and/or Rust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Hands on technical leader with experience in mobile architecture, debugging, release management, app performance, and engineering trade offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Experience building and scaling&amp;nbsp;consumer mobile products&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;1M+ monthly active users (MAU).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;A track record of delivering measurable impact, with clear examples of improving metrics such as&amp;nbsp;user growth, retention, release cadence, product quality, reliability, engineering productivity, or team effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Experience operating in a high-velocity mobile development environment, with a strong focus on release predictability, engineering excellence, app quality, and disciplined execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Proton is an office-first company. We expect you to spend most of your time in the office, and while we do offer some flexibility to work from home, we believe in-person collaboration helps us build the best products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Direct exposure to features such as presence, channels, notifications, sync, low-latency messaging, or engagement loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Track record improving release cadence, crash rate, ANR rate, app-store review quality, or release confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Experience hiring and developing engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Experience spanning both webapp/desktop and mobile (iOS and Android teams), or client plus adjacent backend ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to balance speed, quality, and high engineering standard in fast paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Bonus points for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Rust experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Experience in collaboration, social or other real-time communication products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Background in privacy-first, security-focused, or mission-driven products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Experience with end-to-end encryption, secure communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Experience in community scale or multi device products where reliability and sync are critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Experience building high impact open source solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Experience in applying AI in sustainable manner in the development and test process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We provide all the devices and software you need to excel in your role, ensuring you have the best tools at your disposal to achieve your goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lunch and snacks are provided by Proton every day at our offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Transport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We will always support our employees with transport costs through subsidizing public transport, bike allowances, or parking spaces based on your office location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;At Proton, we are all owners of the company and you get stock options when you join us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Flexible Working:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You can define your own working hours as long as it works with team meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Learning and Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are committed to your professional growth. Proton offers various learning opportunities, including training programs, conferences and events, and continual learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comprehensive health insurance plans, competitive retirement savings options, generous vacation and leave policies, and wellness programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proton is a community-first organization, started with the support of a crowdfunding campaign and built with community input. To this day, Proton’s only source of revenue is user subscriptions. Over 100 million people trust and support Proton, and we put our users and community first in everything we do. Read more about our impact&lt;a class=&quot;Lexical__link&quot; href=&quot;https://proton.me/impact&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Paris: 83,000 - 135,000 EUR gross annually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Other locations: Compensation will be discussed during the interview process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Final compensation will be determined based on the candidate&#39;s qualifications, skills, and previous experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background, feel valued and empowered. We strive to create equal opportunities, promote open dialogue, and support continuous learning to ensure every voice is heard and respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;When you apply for a position, refer a candidate, or are considered for a role at Proton Technologies AG (Proton, we, us, or our), your information is stored in Greenhouse, in accordance with their&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;Lexical__link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Service Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;This information is used to evaluate your suitability for the posted position. We also retain this information for consideration for future roles that you may apply for or that we believe may align with your background and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;If we no longer have a legitimate business need to process your information, we will either delete or anonymize it. Should you have any inquiries about how we use or manage your information, or if you wish to access, correct, or delete your data, please contact our privacy team at careers@proton.ch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Lexical__textItalic&quot;&gt;Proton does not accept unsolicited resumes from any sources other than directly from candidates. We will not pay a fee for any placement resulting from an unsolicited offer, even if the candidate is subsequently hired by Proton.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Lexical__textItalic&quot;&gt;To learn more about our privacy policy, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;Lexical__link&quot; href=&quot;https://boards.eu.greenhouse.io/protongdpr&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Lexical__textItalic&quot;&gt;our privacy policy page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Lexical__textItalic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;#LI-ONSITE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;6:1-6:73;69-141&quot;&gt;Join Proton and build a better internet where privacy is the default&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:435;175-609&quot;&gt;Proton was founded in 2014 by scientists from CERN on a simple truth: &lt;strong&gt;privacy is a fundamental human right&lt;/strong&gt;. Since then, we&#39;ve built the world&#39;s largest encrypted email service (Proton Mail) and expanded into Proton VPN, Proton Drive, Proton Pass, and Proton Calendar — tools used by millions globally to protect their freedom, fight censorship, and keep their data safe. In some situations, Proton has literally helped save lives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:445;611-1055&quot;&gt;We are profitable, independent (no VC control), and selectively hire from the top ~1% of applicants. Our 700+ team members across 50+ countries come from leading organizations and elite academic backgrounds. We move fast, keep hierarchy light, and prioritize impact over optics. If you want to do meaningful work with exceptionally high-caliber people, this is it. Check our open-source projects &lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;https://proton.me/community/open-source&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:20;1062-1081&quot;&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:20;1062-1081&quot;&gt;The Design Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:678;1083-1760&quot;&gt;Proton&#39;s Design team shapes the visual and interaction layer across Mail, Drive, VPN, Pass, and Calendar — products used by millions of people, many of whom rely on them in high-stakes moments. We work at the intersection of security and simplicity: our products must inspire trust without feeling intimidating, and feel refined without sacrificing clarity. Designers are embedded within engineering teams and involved from the very beginning — problem framing, planning, implementation, and quality assurance — not brought in at the mockup stage. The team is organized as a guild: high autonomy, shared standards, and real influence over how design is practiced across Proton.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:254;1762-2015&quot;&gt;We hold a high craft bar. Typography, layout, spacing, color, iconography, motion — the details most companies treat as polish, we treat as the product. If your best work is the work itself — pixels you&#39;re proud to sign — you&#39;ll be in good company here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;30:1-30:19;2097-2115&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;32:1-38:121;2117-2990&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;32:1-32:157;2117-2273&quot;&gt;Own the visual and interaction quality of one or more Proton products — from early concepts through production, until what ships matches the design intent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;33:1-33:149;2274-2422&quot;&gt;Design interfaces that make sophisticated privacy and security features feel intuitive and trustworthy — without oversimplifying what&#39;s underneath&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;34:1-34:114;2423-2536&quot;&gt;Craft visual systems — typography, hierarchy, spacing, color, iconography — that scale across millions of users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;35:1-35:86;2537-2622&quot;&gt;Design motion, transitions, and micro-interactions that add meaning, not decoration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;36:1-36:126;2623-2748&quot;&gt;Create icons, illustrations, and visual assets that strengthen Proton&#39;s visual language and stay consistent across products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;37:1-37:121;2749-2869&quot;&gt;Raise the team&#39;s craft bar through your own execution, design critiques, and contributions to the shared design system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;38:1-38:121;2870-2990&quot;&gt;Partner with Product Managers and engineers to shape solutions early, surface constraints, and stay hands-on through implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;42:1-42:16;2997-3012&quot;&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;44:1-49:108;3014-3828&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;44:1-44:240;3014-3253&quot;&gt;5+ years designing and shipping consumer (B2C and ideally B2B) digital products, with a portfolio demonstrating exceptional visual craft across real products — typography, layout, hierarchy, spacing, color, interaction, and motion (portfolio required with application)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;45:1-45:103;3254-3356&quot;&gt;Proven ability to simplify genuinely complex problems into interfaces that feel obvious in hindsight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;46:1-46:142;3357-3498&quot;&gt;Experience building and evolving design systems — not just consuming them — and understanding how consistency and flexibility work together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;47:1-47:107;3499-3605&quot;&gt;Experience designing motion and micro-interactions as integral parts of production UI, not afterthoughts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;48:1-48:115;3606-3720&quot;&gt;Highly proficient in Figma — moving fluidly from exploration to high-fidelity designs and interactive prototypes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;49:1-49:108;3721-3828&quot;&gt;Ownership beyond your immediate work — you notice quality issues and inconsistencies, and you act on them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;51:1-51:17;3830-3846&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;53:1-55:90;3848-4108&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;53:1-53:97;3848-3944&quot;&gt;Background in visual communication, graphic design, typography, illustration, or motion design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;54:1-54:74;3945-4018&quot;&gt;Portfolio showcasing illustration, iconography, or visual identity work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;55:1-55:90;4019-4108&quot;&gt;Familiarity with front-end implementation and the practical constraints of HTML and CSS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;59:1-59:18;4115-4132&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;62:1-72:44;4166-5382&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;62:1-62:181;4166-4346&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Millions of people trust Proton with their privacy. We answer only to our users — not advertisers, not investors with conflicting agendas, not governments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;63:1-63:136;4347-4482&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Great Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Diverse, collaborative, and tight-knit, with people from MIT, Harvard, Stanford, Caltech, Cambridge, ETH, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;64:1-64:72;4483-4554&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; The right hardware and software to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;65:1-65:165;4555-4719&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; We invest in your growth. Proton is one of the fastest ways to accelerate your career — real challenges, real ownership, from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;66:1-66:113;4720-4832&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong health coverage, solid retirement options, generous leave, and wellness support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;67:1-67:108;4833-4940&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt; From day one, you have a real stake in what we&#39;re building. When Proton wins, you win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;68:1-68:150;4941-5090&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Offices across Geneva, Zürich, Barcelona, London, and more. You&#39;ll spend most of your time collaborating face-to-face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;69:1-69:60;5091-5150&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt; Lunch and snacks on us every day in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;70:1-70:99;5151-5249&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transport:&lt;/strong&gt; We cover public transport, bike allowances, or parking — whichever works for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;71:1-71:89;5250-5338&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working:&lt;/strong&gt; You own your schedule. Outcomes matter more than clock-in times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;72:1-72:44;5339-5382&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation range&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Barcelona: 49,000 - 80,000 EUR gross annually*&lt;br&gt;Other locations: Compensation will be discussed during the interview process&lt;br&gt;*Final compensation will be determined based on the candidate&#39;s qualifications, skills, and previous experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;76:1-76:46;5389-5434&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;79:1-79:338;5468-5805&quot;&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals — regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background — feel valued and empowered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;81:1-81:120;5807-5926&quot;&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;85:1-85:29;5933-5961&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;88:1-88:261;5995-6255&quot;&gt;When you apply for a position at Proton Technologies AG, your information is stored in Greenhouse in accordance with its Service Privacy Policy. This information is used to evaluate your suitability for the posted position and may be retained for future roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;90:1-90:174;6257-6430&quot;&gt;If we no longer have a legitimate business need to process your information, we will either delete or anonymise it. For questions about your data, contact: &lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;mailto:careers@proton.ch&quot;&gt;careers@proton.ch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;92:1-92:93;6432-6524&quot;&gt;Proton does not accept unsolicited CVs from any sources other than directly from candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ONSITE&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__h3&quot;&gt;Join Proton and build a better internet where privacy is the default&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;Proton was founded in 2014 by scientists from CERN on a simple truth: &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;privacy is a fundamental human right&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. Since then, we&#39;ve built the world&#39;s largest encrypted email service (Proton Mail) and expanded into Proton VPN, Proton Drive, Proton Pass, and Proton Calendar — tools used by millions globally to protect their freedom, fight censorship, and keep their data safe. In some situations, Proton has literally helped save lives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;We are profitable, independent (no VC control), and selectively hire from the top ~1% of applicants. Our 700+ team members across 50+ countries come from leading organizations and elite academic backgrounds. We move fast, keep hierarchy light, and prioritize impact over optics. If you want to do meaningful work with exceptionally high-caliber people, this is it. Check our open-source projects &lt;a class=&quot;Lexical__link&quot; href=&quot;https://proton.me/community/open-source&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__h3&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;We&#39;re building something new at Proton and we&#39;re hiring a Senior PM to lead it from the front.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;This role sits at the intersection of product strategy, community dynamics, and Proton&#39;s mission to give people back control over their digital lives. You&#39;ll own the roadmap and execution for a product that brings privacy-first community experiences to millions of users. The team is small and senior; the scope is large. You’ll turn an ambitious product direction into clear strategy, crisp requirements, shipped experiences, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who has lived inside communities products: who understands how engagement compounds, why moderation decisions shape culture, and how trust is built (and destroyed) at scale. If you&#39;ve helped build or grow a platform where users interact, organize, and belong and you want to do it in a way that doesn&#39;t exploit the people using it, this is the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__h3&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Define and drive the product strategy and roadmap end-to-end — from first principles through to shipped features — without waiting for direction from above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Own the metrics that matter: activation, engagement, retention, and community health. Set the targets, instrument the product to track them, and course-correct fast when signals shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Translate deep knowledge of how online communities work — growth loops, moderation, network effects, content dynamics — into a clear product point of view and a prioritized execution plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Lead cross-functional execution across a team of 6–12 engineers plus design, data, and growth — maintain velocity, surface blockers early, and keep the team focused on outcomes over activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Drive structured discovery: user research, competitive analysis, and direct feedback loops that keep product decisions grounded in real behaviour, not assumptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Represent the product externally when needed — to users, partners, and internal leadership — with clarity and confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__h3&quot;&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;10+ years of product management experience, with meaningful time spent on a social, messaging, or community platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of community product mechanics — you can reason clearly about engagement loops, content moderation trade-offs, trust and safety, and network effects without needing it explained&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Analytically sharp: you define success in numbers, run structured experiments, and make data-informed calls without losing sight of user intuition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Strong, direct communicator — you write and speak with precision, push back when something doesn&#39;t make sense, and keep stakeholders aligned without over-meeting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Proven ability to lead a product autonomously: you identify the right problem, build the case, and drive it to shipped — without a roadmap handed to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience building privacy-respecting alternatives to mainstream social or community platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with open-source community protocols (atproto, IETF MLS, Matrix, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Background scaling a community product from early traction to millions of active users&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mainstream community platforms often optimize for attention, ads, and control. Proton has a different opportunity: to build community communication around privacy, user agency, and trust. This role is for a PM who understands the mechanics of social and community products, but wants to apply them in a way that respects the people using them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__h3&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Millions of people trust Proton with their privacy. We answer only to our users — not advertisers, not investors with conflicting agendas, not governments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;A Great Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Diverse, collaborative, and tight-knit, with people from MIT, Harvard, Stanford, Caltech, Cambridge, ETH, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; The right hardware and software to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; We invest in your growth. Proton is one of the fastest ways to accelerate your career — real challenges, real ownership, from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Strong health coverage, solid retirement options, generous leave, and wellness support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; From day one, you have a real stake in what we&#39;re building. When Proton wins, you win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;In-Person Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Offices across Geneva, Zürich, Barcelona, London, and more. You&#39;ll spend most of your time collaborating face-to-face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Lunch and snacks on us every day in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Transport:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; We cover public transport, bike allowances, or parking — whichever works for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Flexible Working:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You own your schedule. Outcomes matter more than clock-in times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__h3&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals — regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background — feel valued and empowered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__h3&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;When you apply for a position at Proton Technologies AG, your information is stored in Greenhouse in accordance with its Service Privacy Policy. This information is used to evaluate your suitability for the posted position and may be retained for future roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;If we no longer have a legitimate business need to process your information, we will either delete or anonymise it. For questions about your data, contact: &lt;a class=&quot;Lexical__link&quot; href=&quot;mailto:careers@proton.ch&quot;&gt;careers@proton.ch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;Proton does not accept unsolicited CVs from any sources other than directly from candidates.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-ONSITE&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Join Proton and build a better internet where privacy is the default&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proton was founded in 2014 by scientists from CERN on a simple truth: &lt;strong&gt;privacy is a fundamental human right&lt;/strong&gt;. Since then, we&#39;ve built the world&#39;s largest encrypted email service (Proton Mail) and expanded into Proton VPN, Proton Drive, Proton Pass, and Proton Calendar — tools used by millions globally to protect their freedom, fight censorship, and keep their data safe. In some situations, Proton has literally helped save lives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are profitable, independent (no VC control), and selectively hire from the top ~1% of applicants. Our 700+ team members across 50+ countries come from leading organizations and elite academic backgrounds. We move fast, keep hierarchy light, and prioritize impact over optics. If you want to do meaningful work with exceptionally high-caliber people, this is it. Check our open-source projects &lt;a href=&quot;https://proton.me/community/open-source&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;The Team and impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;You&#39;re going to work with squad of and will be a part of bigger cross organizational team driving the future of B2B for VPN.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on projects impacting both B2C and B2B, although your main focus is going to be on the B2B.
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Currently working on network segmentation, observability, and security but in the future we plan to build firewall and device posture capabilities for our high profiles customers.Currently working on things like firewall service for the VPN, in the future we want to work on a device posture and many more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Have an impact on a new business segment of Proton, by driving the development of new features and building a long term strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager to lead the development of Proton VPN in the B2B market space.&lt;br&gt;Product at Proton sits at the intersection of Engineering, Growth, Data and Design. Your responsibility will be to participate in developing the product features from scratch with huge potential while Proton is entering a new market. You will be working cross-functionally together with R&amp;amp;D, Security, Back-End teams and others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Work with the senior leadership team to define a strategic vision and roadmap for B2B aspect of Proton VPN.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Ensure that we are building, shipping and supporting the right features that deliver impactful value creation over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Drive product innovation, develop novel, game-changing product features that&amp;nbsp;expand our value proposition to new user segments and increase our defensibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Define and own what success looks like in terms of adoption, activation and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Facilitate hand-in-hand collaboration between product, engineering, growth and marketing to align on the vision and the execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Lead the teams through execution. See through the fog of war and know where to go and what needs to be done quickly and decisively. Troubleshoot and solve problems involving multiple teams inside and outside of product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Conduct market research, competitive analysis, and gather customer feedback to inform product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Anticipate growth ceilings and define scaling strategies to prevent them, that include managing projects beyond pure-product work, and include foundational technology, tools, and processes, such as a customer engagement platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Set a fast pace for the team, help them to overcome blockers and execute faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;We need you to have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;7-10 years&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;of experience in product management in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;B2B SaaS, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;preferably in&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt; security&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;and/or&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;productivity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Proven track-record in successful product and major feature launches in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Strategic leader with an analytical and data-driven mindset, with a track record for delivering products and features on time and with commercial success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Strong empathy for the customer, user-centric mindset, and an unwillingness to lower standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;A strong innate sense for good UX, with a love for design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Experience building and managing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;A work ethic of going above and beyond to make things happen. Ability to be hands-on and thrive in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Deep technical acumen, able to contribute to technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Technical background (ideally a&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt; Computer Science degree &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;with specialization in&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt; Security)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;Even if you don’t meet all the requirements listed above, but feel you could still be a great fit, please still apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Office First:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Collaboration is easier and more effective in person, which is why we have offices in Geneva, Zurich, Prague, Barcelona, Paris, London, Vilnius, Skopje, and Taipei. You can also enjoy working from home up to 30% of the time, while enjoying great company during our three core days in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We provide all the devices and software you need to excel in your role, ensuring you have the best tools at your disposal to achieve your goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lunch and snacks are provided by Proton every day at our offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Transport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We will always support our employees with transport costs through subsidizing public transport, bike allowances, or parking spaces based on your office location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;At Proton, we are all owners of the company and you get stock options when you join us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Flexible Working:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You can define your own working hours as long as it works with team meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Learning and Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are committed to your professional growth. Proton offers various learning opportunities, including training programs, conferences and events, and continual learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comprehensive health insurance plans, competitive retirement savings options, generous vacation and leave policies, and wellness programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proton is a community-first organization, started with the support of a crowdfunding campaign and built with community input. To this day, Proton’s only source of revenue is user subscriptions. Over 100 million people trust and support Proton, and we put our users and community first in everything we do. Read more about our impact&lt;a class=&quot;Lexical__link&quot; href=&quot;https://proton.me/impact&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Barcelona: 50.000 - 95.000 EUR gross annually*&lt;br&gt;Other locations: Compensation will be discussed during the interview process&lt;br&gt;*Final compensation will be determined based on the candidate&#39;s qualifications, skills, and previous experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background, feel valued and empowered. We strive to create equal opportunities, promote open dialogue, and support continuous learning to ensure every voice is heard and respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;When you apply for a position, refer a candidate, or are considered for a role at Proton Technologies AG (Proton, we, us, or our), your information is stored in Greenhouse, in accordance with their&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;Lexical__link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Service Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;This information is used to evaluate your suitability for the posted position. We also retain this information for consideration for future roles that you may apply for or that we believe may align with your background and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;If we no longer have a legitimate business need to process your information, we will either delete or anonymize it. Should you have any inquiries about how we use or manage your information, or if you wish to access, correct, or delete your data, please contact our privacy team at careers@proton.ch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Lexical__textItalic&quot;&gt;Proton does not accept unsolicited resumes from any sources other than directly from candidates. We will not pay a fee for any placement resulting from an unsolicited offer, even if the candidate is subsequently hired by Proton.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Lexical__textItalic&quot;&gt;To learn more about our privacy policy, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;Lexical__link&quot; href=&quot;https://boards.eu.greenhouse.io/protongdpr&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Lexical__textItalic&quot;&gt;our privacy policy page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;Lexical__textItalic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;
